","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vXLUeAyk43qpeFqDItAfKyly5A5.jpg"},{"id":1033672,"name":"Mourad Frarema","role":"Khalid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrrFy8ZfK6daiw9OfkCZolnAowD.jpg"},{"id":583382,"name":"Nathanaël Maïni","role":"Guard Sampierro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pFWvNoXZ5SmcBDmYIkryejRhq7Z.jpg"},{"id":1880944,"name":"Kamel Saadi","role":"Arab","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kjjXdDCZRRKzRGbx152Yu5Fj9oQ.jpg"},{"id":1650409,"name":"Slim El Hedli","role":"Arab","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/436qfHPcTj6DQiwevkiTWpfBU2B.jpg"},{"id":1170829,"name":"Farid Elouardi","role":"Arab","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arJaXTdbhd8l2RSIqRz2x3kXF4L.jpg"},{"id":6457089,"name":"Veronica Ghio","role":"The Blonde from Marbella"},{"id":6457091,"name":"Charles Maestracci","role":"Corsican"},{"id":6457092,"name":"Laurent Blanquet","role":"Corsican"},{"id":6457094,"name":"Jean-Pierre Guinebert","role":"Corsican"},{"id":1017271,"name":"Pascal Henault","role":"Corsican","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fp4cTf6aQqLXNB4ebGAF1F31vYX.jpg"},{"id":1885446,"name":"Hakim Sid","role":"Shoes racket","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dtpa9QGws5brmfZRzipXjwbIWAe.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il profeta","overview":"Malik El Djebena ha 19 anni quando viene condannato a sei anni di prigione. Entra con poco o nulla, una banconota ripiegata su se stessa e dei vestiti troppo usurati, che a detta delle guardie non vale la pena di conservare. Quando esce ha un impero e tre macchine pronte a scortare i suoi primi passi.","tagline":"Uccidi o sarai ucciso"},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Prophet","overview":"Sentenced to six years in prison, Malik El Djebena is alone in the world and can neither read nor write. On his arrival at the prison, he seems younger and more brittle than the others detained there. At once he falls under the sway of a group of Corsicans who enforce their rule in the prison. As the 'missions' go by, he toughens himself and wins the confidence of the Corsican group.","tagline":"Escaping the prison of life."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Condamné à six ans de prison, Malik El Djebena ne sait ni lire, ni écrire. À son arrivée en Centrale, seul au monde, il paraît plus jeune, plus fragile que les autres détenus. Il a 19 ans. D'emblée, il tombe sous la coupe d'un groupe de prisonniers corses qui fait régner sa loi dans la prison. Le jeune homme apprend vite. Au fil des \"missions\", il s'endurcit et gagne la confiance des corses. Mais, très vite, Malik utilise toute son intelligence pour développer discrètement son propre réseau...","tagline":"S'échapper de la prison de sa vie"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZtVeZg3Ye9IdxWxYBJjp8WWykK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jEJDjDBT6KCoS4WOBq68vZMbFk2.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":21575,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZtVeZg3Ye9IdxWxYBJjp8WWykK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7ZtVeZg3Ye9IdxWxYBJjp8WWykK.jpg","language":"it","width":931,"height":1331},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZtVeZg3Ye9IdxWxYBJjp8WWykK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7ZtVeZg3Ye9IdxWxYBJjp8WWykK.jpg","language":"it","width":931,"height":1331},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/azChT9LYWHGslesRuoPX1ocGyGf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/azChT9LYWHGslesRuoPX1ocGyGf.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iVzbyikYBdcyIVg1uK9ePVtLzDy.jpg","previewUrl":"htt